  [ Add entry ] | [ Move up ] | [ Move down ] | [ Remove ]
  --
  Provenance | changed by marco | 2026-07-24 09:41 UTC
  {#
    Version | Written | By | Change from the one before
    v7 | 2026-07-24 09:41 | marco | Process parameters re-calibrated
    v6 | 2026-07-18 16:02 | marco | Curve Template: added IRS 10Y–30Y
    v5 | 2026-07-14 11:27 | joey | Price source set to vintage ore.samples.2016-02-05
  }
  [ Save ] | [ Cancel ]
